<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38574" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōductĭlis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		produco. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>That may be drawn out</i>, <i>ductile</i>, <i>productile</i>: productile, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλατόν</span>, Gloss.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Of beaten work</i>, <i>of highly
				wrought metal</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cherubim aurei et productiles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Exod. 25, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tubae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ecclus. 50, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
